 "summary": "A family of five NPN epitaxial silicon transistors for general switching and amplification, in the three-lead TO-92 through-hole package with straight or formed leads. They share a 100 mA collector rating and 500 mW dissipation and differ in voltage rating: BC546 takes 65 V collector to emitter, BC547 and BC550 45 V, BC548 and BC549 30 V; BC549 and BC550 carry tighter noise-figure limits. Current gain at 2 mA is sorted into classes A, B and C, carried as the last letter of the marking. The PNP complements are BC556 to BC560.",
